  "term": "kola nut",
  "definition": "Kola nut is the nut of Cola nitida, commonly consumed in Nigeria and West Africa. In the supplied source, it is discussed as a substance used by some pregnant women for morning sickness and dizziness, and as a biological exposure being studied for possible effects on brain development.",
